  "observed": [
    "windowSnitch.addAllCards -> windowShowCardRect.addhandCards -> SelfCardsArea.addCards/createCardUi/reorderAllCards; this is distinct from BaseWindow.showAction scale.",
    "SelfCardsArea.ctor moveCardTime=0.26666666666666666; numeric hidden-card createCardUi starts at(display.cx,display.height) in its container.",
    "windowSnitch.playClickCardAction runs ScaleTo(20/30,1.5) and FadeOut(20/30) in parallel. Its CallFunc is also in Spawn, so the nested0.5s close timer must not be described as starting after the666.7ms animation."
  ],
  "user_requested_adaptation": [
    "Use bottom-left scale origin for accepted selections.",
    "Superseded by the 2026-11-15 request to follow the official close timing: local native confirmation/visual close at500ms; the underlying scale/fade action remains666.7ms. Connected play still submits the native result immediately, delaying only visual close, so animation does not consume server response time; original selected Button/link/custom callbacks remain authoritative.",
    "Expose one xinsha-only component; generic dialog.open installs it by default; owner extension delegates instead of layering its legacy animations.",
    "DOM entry coordinates map the hidden-card source into the current viewport and area; cubic-bezier(.39,.575,.565,1) is a local easing adaptation, not a recovered exact official parameter.",
    "Existing card transform/individual scale is retained; changing to a bottom-left origin applies one translation compensation so the first frame keeps the clicked lower-left corner."
  ],
